 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・stauden.de・品種とも「晩秋に咲き終わった茎を切る」で、秋の片付けと読んだ（花がら摘み・返り咲きの記述はない）ので機械の B ではなく A。RHS の「速く広がり厄介になる可能性」は可能性の話で、侵略的の明記ではないので E にしない",
  "management_type_quote": "Cut back flowered stems in late autumn",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[日照] 今のマスターの日照（半日陰）で西日耐性を決め直した（文献の日照 日向〜半日陰 なら △）\n[MBG/品種] Foliage tends to burn in hot, dry, sunny summer conditions.\n[MBG/品種] Plants do not perform well in the deep South (south of USDA Zone 7).\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or East-facing or North-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／RHS・品種] Can spread rapidly once established and has the potential to become a nuisance.（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／stauden.de・品種] mäßig versamend（読み直し）\n[地下茎 2／NC State・種] Windflowers spread by rhizomes and make a good ground cover when given room to spread.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 空欄、文を読み直して 1（[stauden.de・cultivar] mäßig versamend）\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 地下茎：言い回しの照合では 2、文を読み直して 3（[RHS・品種] Can spread rapidly once established and has the potential to become a nuisance.）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち、こぼれ種）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[管理タイプの見直し] 文を読んで隔離推奨型にしなかったので、侵略的 から 強い に下げた",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] 'Honorine Jobert' is a vigorous, fibrous-rooted, mounding, compact Japanese anemone hybrid cultivar which typically grows to 3-4' tall and spreads by creeping rhizomes.",
